{title: 640 - For Beauty of Meadows}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #640 • ANNIVERSARY SONG • 11.12.10.10}
{lyricist: Walter H. Farquharson}
{composer: Jane Marshall}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 640}
{meta: tune ANNIVERSARY SONG}
{meta: meter 11.12.10.10}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]For [G]beauty [Em]of [A]meadows, [Bm]for [G]grandeur of [A]trees,
[D]For flowers [Bm/F#]of [A]woodlands, [A7/G]for creatures [Em]of [C#dim]seas,
[D]For [G]all [F#m]You [Em]created [D]and [Bm]gave us to [C#dim]share,
[C#dim]We [D]praise [F#m/C#]You, [Bm]Creator, [A7/C#]extolling [G]your [Em]care.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]As [G]stewards [Em]of [A]beauty [Bm]received [G]at Your [A]hand,
[D]As creatures [A]who [F#m]hear [A7/G]Your most [Bm]urgent [Em]command,
[D]We [G]turn [F#m]from [Em]our [A]wasteful [Bm]destruction [C#dim]of [Bm]life,
[C#dim]Confessing [F#m/C#]our [Bm]failures, [F#m]confessing [Em]our [D]strife.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]Teach [G]us [F#m]once [Em]again [A]to [D]be [Bm]gardeners [G]in [A]peace;
[D]All [G]nature [A]around [A7/G]us is [Bm]ours [G]but [Em]on [C#dim]lease;
[D]Your [G]name [F#m]we [Em]would [A]hallow [D]in [Bm]all that we [C#dim]do,
[C#dim]Fulfilling [Bm]our [A]calling, [F#m]creating [G]with [Em]You.
{end_of_verse}
